linalg = distributed: dense N_mu x N_mu matrices are 2D distributed across the process mesh (N_mu = 597)
[config provenance] low_mem_bands = true (deck)
low_mem_bands = true: the two-face wavefunction carrier (band chunks of 16); required for the raw-parent (k_irr) route, which contracts G and the ISDF pair densities on the WFN's own k rows.

CONFIGURATION PROVENANCE
