[config provenance] this deck names 1 LEGACY self-energy-axis key(s); they are honored, and the canonical axes resolved to compute_mode = gn_ppm, qp_solver = one_shot_dft.

PROCESSOR ARCHITECTURE
----------------------
MPI ranks      : 16
